{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Quantum Void",
    "steam_appid": 2710650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Void is an exploration game revolving around space and dimensional mysteries, all set in a retro-futuristic universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>VR available but optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DETAILS OF THE PROJECT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo dev working on a dream project. I and my artist friends made everything in this game as well as related content. No AI or generative neural network has been used whatsoever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to support this, please share the project around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord and say hello :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee of the mega-corporation CSMO. You are specialized in orbital maintenance and engineering, and have been assigned to the 6th CSMO fleet, sent to explore and assess the profitability of distant uncharted worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The macrofield drive is a fairly new technology allowing incredible speed through spacetime, and the board of CSMO does not want to be undercut by another company on this gold rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new and untested technology has its risks though, especially when dealing with the fabric of reality. On day 57 of the fleet's journey, you are tasked with some routine maintenance on one of the vessels. To save some time, you are required to perform the repairs during the macrofield travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something goes wrong and you and your tiny welding-tug ship are sent flying outside the field, forcing a hard stop for the entire fleet and causing violent perturbations of space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've regained your senses, you are alone in your ship, lost in an unexplored stellar system scattered with debris of the 6th fleet. What happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from interest point to another using the jump drive on your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your radio and computer database to retrieve and make sense of the information you find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the fleet wreckages with your small ship and board them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During on-foot phases, explore and take advantage of every system of the ships (Electrical grid, computer network, air vents, crew emails and chats, etc.) to get to your objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life, you might not be alone in here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the right choices and explore the maps thoroughly, every detail can have its importance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you decipher the anomaly's secrets? Can you find a way to break the anomaly's hold on the star system, and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown, find the crews, and survive the Quantum Void.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Void is an exploration game revolving around space and dimensional mysteries, all set in a retro-futuristic universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>VR available but optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DETAILS OF THE PROJECT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo dev working on a dream project. I and my artist friends made everything in this game as well as related content. No AI or generative neural network has been used whatsoever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to support this, please share the project around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the discord and say hello :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an employee of the mega-corporation CSMO. You are specialized in orbital maintenance and engineering, and have been assigned to the 6th CSMO fleet, sent to explore and assess the profitability of distant uncharted worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The macrofield drive is a fairly new technology allowing incredible speed through spacetime, and the board of CSMO does not want to be undercut by another company on this gold rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new and untested technology has its risks though, especially when dealing with the fabric of reality. On day 57 of the fleet's journey, you are tasked with some routine maintenance on one of the vessels. To save some time, you are required to perform the repairs during the macrofield travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something goes wrong and you and your tiny welding-tug ship are sent flying outside the field, forcing a hard stop for the entire fleet and causing violent perturbations of space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've regained your senses, you are alone in your ship, lost in an unexplored stellar system scattered with debris of the 6th fleet. What happened?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from interest point to another using the jump drive on your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your radio and computer database to retrieve and make sense of the information you find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the fleet wreckages with your small ship and board them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During on-foot phases, explore and take advantage of every system of the ships (Electrical grid, computer network, air vents, crew emails and chats, etc.) to get to your objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life, you might not be alone in here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the right choices and explore the maps thoroughly, every detail can have its importance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you decipher the anomaly's secrets? Can you find a way to break the anomaly's hold on the star system, and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown, find the crews, and survive the Quantum Void.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lost in an unexplored star system after a dimensional anomaly dispersed your fleet, you pick up signals scattered throughout the system. Explore the wrecks of the corpo-fleet, discover the secrets of the anomaly, and try to escape from this star of doom!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
